BESSEL FUNCTIONS OF FRACTIONAL ORDER (445)
Formulas of Rayleigh's Type
10.2.24 \sqrt{3\pi/z}I_{n+1}(z)=z^{n}\left(\frac{1}{z}\frac{d}{dz}\right)^{n}\frac{\sinh z}{z}
10.2.25 \sqrt{3\pi/z}I_{n-1}(z)=z^{n}\left(\frac{1}{z}\frac{d}{dz}\right)^{n}\frac{\cosh z}{z}
(n=0,1,2,\ldots)
Formulas for \Gamma_{n+1}^{2}(z)-I^{2}_{n-1}(z)
10.2.26 (1\pi/z)[I_{1\pi/2}^{2}(z)-I_{2\pi-1}^{2}(z)]=-z^{2}
10.2.28 (1\pi/z)[I_{12}^{2}(z)-I_{2\pi/2\pi}^{2}(z)]=z^{2}-z^{-4}
10.2.29 (1\pi/z)[I_{12}^{2}(z)-I_{2\pi/2\pi}^{2}(z)]=-z^{2}+3z^{-4}-9z^{-6} Generating Functions
10.2.30 \frac{1}{z}\sinh\sqrt{2^{2}-2izt}=\sum\limits_{0}^{\infty}\frac{(-it)^{n}}{n!}[\sqrt{3\pi/z}I_{n-1\hat{\infty}}(z)]
(2|t|<|z|)
10.2.31 \frac{1}{z}\cosh\sqrt{2^{2}+2izt}=\sum\limits_{0}^{\infty}\frac{(it)^{n}}{n!}[\sqrt{3\pi/z}I_{n-1\hat{\infty}}(z)]
Derivatives With Respect to Order
10.2.32 \left[\frac{\partial}{\partial r}I_{x}(x)\right]_{x+1}=-\frac{1}{2\pi x}\left[\mathrm{Ei}(2x)e^{-x}-E_{1}(-2x)e^{\tau}\right]
10.2.33 \left[\frac{\partial}{\partial r}I_{x}(x)\right]_{n-1\hat{\infty}}=\frac{1}{2\pi x}\left[\mathrm{Ei}(2x)e^{-x}+E_{1}(-2x)e^{\tau}\right]
10.2.34 \left[\frac{\partial}{\partial r}K_{x}(x)\right]_{n-1\hat{\infty}}=\mp\sqrt{\pi/2x}\mathrm{Ei}(-2x)e^{\tau}
For Ei(x) and Ei(x), see 5.1.1, 5.1.2. Addition Theorems and Degenerate Forms
